 the three younger members of the cabal could have some really interesting chemistry. All three of them have the potential to really help each other grow or emotionally devastate each other, whether or not they get involved with each other. Phoenix is the guy who jumps in bed with you and then ignores you the following day because he doesn't know how to process it; Ragnar has basically been conditioned to take what he can when he can, but is afraid of screwing up a chance for something better; and Lynx is the eager young guy who doesn't really know any better. Three boys who know enough to go after what they want, and not enough to know not to go after it so greedily.<br /> <br /> Of course, their carrying-on would also affect the rest of the cabal: Dr. Asphodel and Moonstone watching their own experiences play out before them, and Binder trying desperately to keep the cabal from imploding.<br /> <br /> Could be fertile soil for some juicy character stuff, what do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6498_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6498\" data-vbnamecard=\"6498\">Haberdasher</a>: We've definitely got the makings of an emotional hurricane incoming, and I think it'll be <i>wicked</i>. <br /> <br /> Looking forward to seeing this unfold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T06:36:51-07:00","id":929216,"title":"","content":"My Time spells forsee lots of drama in the future... Nice! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T15:43:18-07:00","id":929422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=929041#post929041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2992_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2992\" data-vbnamecard=\"2992\">crapcarp</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12046\" data-vbnamecard=\"12046\">Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon</a> Reading this, I'm starting to think that the three younger members of the cabal could have some really interesting chemistry. All three of them have the potential to really help each other grow or emotionally devastate each other, whether or not they get involved with each other. Phoenix is the guy who jumps in bed with you and then ignores you the following day because he doesn't know how to process it; Ragnar has basically been conditioned to take what he can when he can, but is afraid of screwing up a chance for something better; and Lynx is the eager young guy who doesn't really know any better. Three boys who know enough to go after what they want, and not enough to know not to go after it so greedily.<br /> <br /> Of course, their carrying-on would also affect the rest of the cabal: Dr. Asphodel and Moonstone watching their own experiences play out before them, and Binder trying desperately to keep the cabal from imploding.<br /> <br /> Could be fertile soil for some juicy character stuff, what do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, in Phoenix's case, he'd probably apologize to you the morning after when he's sobered up and then ignoring you to try and put it behind him as another mistake of his. His drunk self would use sex as another way to forget about the pain, whereas his sober self would realize that could potentially hurt others. Still pretty destructive behavior, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member",