stom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T11:51:07-08:00","id":1017736,"title":"","content":"I can't think of anything Binder would need to do that afternoon; just prepare the sanctum for company and then cast some spells come night time.<br /> <br /> Hopefully setting up my phone to alert me when this thread gets a post will help me keep up a little better!<br /> <br /> Edit: So, just to be clear, are we going into Moonstone's Onerios, or are we summoning one of his Goetia?<br /> <br /> Edit2: Since I just got my first Experience, would now be an alright time to buy a dot of Sanctum?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","user":"MagicSwordsman","date":". 12-15-2016, 02:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T13:14:38-08:00","id":1018560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MagicSwordsman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1017736#post1017736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: So, just to be clear, are we going into Moonstone's Onerios, or are we summoning one of his Goetia?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was also wondering this. If we're doing an Oneiros jaunt to find the thing, Spade probably needs to bring a soulstone. I was thinking of having Moonstone create a soulstone sometime after joining the Guardians, since they're big on that and creating demesnes to cast safely in- this would be a good introduction to them. Just doing a summoning (and probably trying not to get murdered/possessed) is good too though.<br /> <br /> Also I realized I don't have a picture or anything for Hakim, so here's him and Moonstone lol: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/IQ-PIeO2PXo\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/IQ-PIeO2PXo</a><br /> <br /> (slightly risque music video)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T21:16:51-08:00","id":1018678,"title":"","content":"Sorry again for the delay! Got the new post up now.<br /> <br /> I'll have to review the info on the Oneiros / Goetic summoning before the stuff that would happen during the next scene, so I can remind myself how it works.<br 