,"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T19:02:11-07:00","id":1419889,"title":"","content":"Okay, really quick and bullet point, but here are the ideas I have so far.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Concept:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A neopagan obsessed with ephemeral beings</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Sympathetic Name:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Peter Hunter </span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Shadow Name: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Eurydice's Heir</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Path:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moros</span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Order: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Adamantine Arrow</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Legacy:</b> n/a, but will probably pick up a Spirit-related one later. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Virtue:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Curious</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Vice:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hasty</span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Background:</span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Former high school teacher, mid to late 30s, single. Greek neopagan since teens. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Looked for a career change, so planned to go back to the University of Chicago to get a Masters in Classics</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Awakened during the first week, causing him to experience a particularly Orphic Mystery Play of Stygia, where he met various Chthonic entities from the Greco-Roman underworld. Scribed his name in Orpheus\u2019 place to give him another chance to escape the Underworld with Eurydice. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Basically had to drop out of his program because he was MIA for so long, but doesn\u2019t regret it since he gets to experience the Supernatural (and Supernal) directly. Blamed it on a mental break/mid-life crisis to the faculty, who (mostly) bought it. Tutors high school students to keep up appearances. Sometimes tutors freshman it at the University if he needs an excuse to be on campus or stick his nose downtown. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Sees spirits, ghosts, and goetia as different manifestations of the divine, despite most Mages categorizing them as entirely separate and unrelated phenomena. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Joined the Arrows by reasoning that Greek Gods and Heroes both grow through conflict, be it with nature, each other, or themselves. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- Lived in La Grange prior to the Deathstorm, but didn\u2019t get super involved with other Mages. Is now concerned that something is going down, and that the ghosts of the deceased may yet linger, becoming restless ancestors for the Pentacle. </span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Arcana: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Death 3, Matter 1, Fate 1, Mind 1</span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">STA: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Meet a spirit. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>STA: </b>Form a neopagan support group. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>LTA: </b>Meet the goetia of a Greek God. </span><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ob: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Convince an Adept or Master of Spirit to take him as an apprentice.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"