d":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T22:02:51-07:00","id":1420405,"title":"","content":"Cool.<br /> <br /> (10 character padding)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T07:39:37-07:00","id":1420975,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone! Happy Friday. Hope your week has been going well. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> A few updates on my schedule. Due to a change in my work schedule on Thursdays, I now have a few hours in the morning during which I have some down time before I go to work. I'll also be working later, and sometimes the evenings are not as busy, so I might have extra time at night to respond. I also will now be teleworking on Friday, and it's easier for me to post on Friday because those days also tend to be faster and I don't have to deal with a firewall. This means that in general, Thursday - Sunday is going to be my prime time for responding. I'll still try to post throughout the week to keep everything moving, though.<br /> <br /> Another topic I just wanted to clarify that came up with the original group as well. This is a LGBT+ friendly game and you are absolutely welcome to explore gender, sexuality, and more with your character if you want to. Mage is an adult themed game and I trust we can all be mature about this with regards to roleplaying. Any &quot;on camera&quot; scenes involving sex need to be described sensitively and tastefully (no explicit details), and in compliance with the forum's rules on sexually explicit content. Also, please do not by any means feel compelled or obligated to make this part of your character. Being part of the LGBT+ community is not a requirement for your background.<br /> <br /> Before I am ready to put up the initial posts and start the game, I still need the following:<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12046\" data-vbnamecard=\"12046\">Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon</a> (<b>Lynx</b>):<br /> (1) Mentor: Please decide on which existing NPC you'd like to be your Order mentor, or give me a general, brief character concept of a new NPC and I will start to flesh them out myself. If you have questions about an NPC posted on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; section on the IC thread, let me know. Raven was your previous mentor. She is kind of an enigma and sort of strange at times. She has her sanctum in Bemis Woods. She was the mage who brought you into the Spirit World to teach you basics of how to use Spirit mage to influence those ephemera. If you click on the link on her name on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; post, it brings you to the IC post when you first met her, and that might refresh your memory.<br /> <br /> (2) Residence: I need a general description of what kind of house/apartment/shelter you live in and where it is generally located.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> (<b>Eurydice\u2019s Heir</b>):<br /> (1) Character sheet: I need you to make a post in the OOC thread with your actual game stats. Please use the same post to include all of the additional information we need to know about your character (aspirations/Obsessions, background, photo, etc.).<br /> <br /> (2) Aspirations/Obsession: Your Obsession is probably more appropriate for a short-term aspiration. And honestly, your mentor will probably start as an adept in at least one arcanum, so you could easily pick a mentor who starts with Spirit 4. An Obsession should be like a long-term aspiration that relates specifically to the Supernal realms, a specific known Mystery, or something else related to the Awakened world or magic. Your long-term aspiration might possibly be a better fit as an Obsession, but you might consider something broader like &quot;study goetia of Greek mythological concepts.&quot; Please tweak your aspirations/Obsession accordingly.<br /> <br /> (3) Background: Please flesh out more details about your background. This doesn't need to be lengthy, but it should provide a little more clarification about who Eurydice's Heir is both pre- and post-Awakening.<br /> <br /> (4) Photo: Please post a link to a photo or photos that represent how you view your character.<br /> <br /> (5) Mentor: Please decide on which existing NPC you'd like to be your Order mentor, or give me a general, brief character concept of a new NPC and I will start to flesh them out myself. If you have questions about an NPC posted on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; section on the IC thread, let me know.<br /> <br /> (6) Residence: I need a general description of what kind of house/apartment/shelter you live in and where it is generally located.<br /> <br /> (7) Character and setting connections: Please come up with at least 3 general links to the setting and/or other characters. Look to Lynx or Caliginosa's character sheet for examples.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25593-drsteve\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25593\" data-vbnamecard=\"25593\">DrSteve</a> (<b>Morganna</b>):<br /> (1) Aspirations/Obsession: Can you clarify what you mean by \u201cbe less scared\u201d? Or perhaps rephrase this a bit? Your other aspirations/Obsession are great.<br /> <br /> (2) Background: You made a few posts after I asked follow-up questions with information about your background and Hannah pre- and post-Awakening. Please consolidate the extra information into one post, as well as the rest of the requested information listed here.<br /> <br /> (3) Photo: Please post a link to a photo or photos that represent how you view your character.<br /> <br /> (4) Mentor: Please decide on which existing NPC you'd like to be your Order mentor, or give me a general, brief character concept of a new NPC and I will start to flesh them out myself. If you have questions about an NPC posted on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; section on the IC thread, let me know.<br /> <br /> (5) Residence: I need a general description of what kind of house/apartment/shelter you live in and where it is generally located.<br /> <br /> (6) Character and setting connections: Please come up with at least 3 general links to the setting and/or other characters. Look to Lynx or Caliginosa's character sheet for examples.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12398-darchon5\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12398\" data-vbnamecard=\"12398\">DArchon5</a> (<b>Fatewise</b>):<br /> (1) Character sheet: I need you to make a post in the OOC thread with your actual game stats. Please use the same post to include all of the additional information we need to know about your character (aspirations/Obsessions, background, photo, etc.).<br /> <br /> (2) Aspirations/Obsession: Please come up with 3 aspirations (2 short-term, 1 long-term) and 1 Obsession per the standard character creation rules.<br /> <br /> (3) Background: Please continue to finalize details about your character, and consolidate into one larger post with your character sheet and all of the other requested information listed here.<br /> <br /> (4) Photo: Please post a link to a photo or photos that represent how you view your character.<br /> <br /> (5) Mentor: Please decide on which existing NPC you'd like to be your Order mentor, or give me a general, brief character concept of a new NPC and I will start to flesh them out myself. If you have questions about an NPC posted on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; section on the IC thread, let me know.<br /> <br /> (6) Residence: I need a general description of what kind of house/apartment/shelter you live in and where it is generally located.:<br /> <br /> (7) Character and setting connections: Please come up with at least 3 general links to the setting and/or other characters. Look to Lynx or Caliginosa's character sheet for examples.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1096_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1096\" data-vbnamecard=\"1096\">squidheadjax</a> (<b>Caliginosa</b>):<br /> As far as I can tell, your character is completely ready to go! Thank you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> And just to help motivate us all to keep moving, anyone who has all of the above to-do list complete before I wake up on <b>Monday morning</b> (around 6 am EST, or GMT-4 currently) can start with a <b>free Beat</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T08:04:59-07:00","id":1420979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rwknoll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1420975#post1420975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(1) Mentor: Please decide on which existing NPC you'd like to be your Order mentor, or give me a general, brief character concept of a new NPC and I will start to flesh them out myself. If you have questions about an NPC posted on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; section on the IC thread, let me know. Raven was your previous mentor. She is kind of an enigma and sort of strange at times. She has her sanctum in Bemis Woods. She was the mage who brought you into the Spirit World to teach you basics of how to use Spirit mage to influence those ephemera. If you click on the link on her name on the &quot;List of Supporting Characters&quot; post, it brings you to the IC post when you first met her, and that might refresh your memory.<br /> <br /> (2) Residence: I need a general description of what kind of house/apartment/shelter you live in and where it is generally located.</div> </div> </div> </div>1: I'll stick with Raven, just to keep it simple. Reading up on her demeanour, it seems right for Lynx.<br /> <br /> 2: With Resources 3, I imagine Lynx has a small but comfortable basement apartment in the suburbs. Private owner, perhaps? That could be a plot point. Or hindrance. Or werewolf. Who knows. Maybe 10-20 minutes away from the university by foot? In the north-west, not too far away from the Bemis Woods, since the place has importance to Lynx, and coincidences are a thing. <br /> <br /> Tell me if you need more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Character Sheet: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=1419997#post1419997\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar &quot;Lynx&quot; Dalgren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12046-kvitebj\u00f8rn-kong-valemon","name":"Kvitebj\u00f8rn Kong Valemon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","