.theonyxpath.com/member/25593-drsteve\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25593\" data-vbnamecard=\"25593\">DrSteve</a> - I really like the creativity here. As a Storyteller, I'm less experienced with the Astral realms so I'm a little unsure of how to evaluate how realistic your idea is and the mechanics of how it works. Can you explain further here in the OOC thread what you are proposing in your post regarding the candle and the Oneiros?<br /> <br /> Also, I'm going to say that no, Morganna can't see the Supernal entity that is visible to the Heir. Honestly I don't understand those mechanics either, Signs of Sorcery clarifies it a little but not much. But for now, I'll say that only the Heir can view it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> - Sorry, we're in the same scene still. I haven't advanced it yet because very little has actually happened so far with regards to story advancement. I will indicate scene changes very clearly in my IC posts using this text: <b>* NEW SCENE *</b><br /> <br /> In my experience, many mages tend to be fantastic at combat without even building for it, but primarily when they have advance warning of a threat. That's the beauty of the Mage system: It really gives you an incentive for gaining information and problem-solving creatively.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry. It's been a week. Basically a spell that checks in with the astral to see if an Oneiros is present. The problem is the range. According to core rules, you only have to be thinking of somebody to find their Oneiros. Not sure how this should translate into a real where space is more a mental construct.<br /> <br /> Basically, the candle pings the astral to see if any of the desired Onerios's are present, the mages mental image gives the candle the &quot;address&quot; for the ping. The color change is a special effect.<br /> <br /> Sorry, I'm really tired right now and didn't expect and failed coup on Tuesday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25593-drsteve","name":"DrSteve","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-10T21:16:37-08:00","id":1431786,"title":"","content":"I think it's fair to say it's been a week for all of us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments"